// Merilin Vaht („Kohviveski”), used-machine seller Ain Pärtel, ad seller Kaarel Mänd („Linnaelu”), app customer service
// Kertu, consumer adviser Margit Kuld, money-skills trainer Peeter Vaino (on Ülle's „Päevateema”), furniture shop
// „Kodumaailm” and its customer service Siim.
// Grammar (B2 spiral, docs/METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md §5):
//   total vs partial object and subject in money texts (ostsime masina / ei ostnud masinat / arveid tuli palju) —
//     taught in 051 (notice, rule table; option-gap text, gaps; used in the Kasuta talk and letter), back in 053 (dialogue,
