// kergendus, usaldusväärne, nõudlik, kannatlik, keegi, kunagi, isegi.
//   051 Linnaelu article on the Mets family budget; the washing machine; Jaan calls about a dishwasher (listening);
//       Kasuta: three offers for the café's espresso machine, Jaan and Kadri decide, a letter to the supplier.
//   052 Ülle's radio talk on advertising tricks; the „Kokk Pluss” terms; Kasuta: negotiating an ad package for the café
//       with Kaarel Mänd, an honest ad text and a letter.
//   053 Jaan's call to „Kokk Pluss”, consumer rights Q&A, the consumer adviser's advice (listening); Kasuta: Anna's
